{
  "slug": "ultrapowers",
  "name": "Ultrapowers",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Research-driven development workflow that ensures agents verify knowledge before writing code, extends Superpowers with deep research, skills auditing, and no auto-commits.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **22 skills**, **4 agents** and **6 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (22): `autonomous-decision` (Use at any in-skill decision point — task complexity, scope tier, fast-path eligibility, audit depth, plan granularity, debugging…), `brainstorming` (Use before any new feature, component, design, or behavior change in any project, EXCEPT bug fixes and test…), `consulting-the-advisor` (Use when running an executor session (sonnet/haiku main session, or sonnet/haiku controller in subagent-driven-development) on multi-step work —…), `deep-research` (Use when brainstorming completes and a spec is approved — researches the current state of the art for…), `dispatching-parallel-agents` (Use when investigating 2+ unrelated failures, bugs, or subsystems in parallel (read-only evidence gathering) — NOT for plan-driven…), `executing-plans` (Use when executing a plan on a harness without subagent support, or when pausing and resuming execution across…), `finishing-a-development-branch` (Use when implementation is complete, all tests pass, and you need to decide how to integrate the work…), `no-permission-asks` (Use when responding to any user task — establishes that mid-task permission-asks (\"Want me to X?\", \"Shall I…), and 14 more\n- **Agents** (4): `advisor` (Mid-task strategic checkpoint), `code-reviewer` (Use after completing a major project step, feature, or subsystem to review the implementation against the original plan…), `planner` (Software architect agent for designing implementation plans), `research-fetch` (Fast lookup agent for web search and documentation fetching)\n- **Hooks** (6): `SessionStart`, `UserPromptSubmit`, `PreToolUse`, `PostToolUse`, `TaskCompleted`, `Stop`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install ultrapowers@claude-community` from `ennio-datatide/ultrapowers`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "opencode"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 22,
    "agent": 4,
    "hook": 6
  },
  "sourceType": "community",
  "author": {
    "name": "Ennio Maldonado",
    "url": "https://www.enniomaldonado.com"
  },
